'''Gold Vampire's Edge''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife that was awarded to the player who placed '''1st''' on the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]] leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
The Gold Vampire's Edge has the same design as [[Vampire's Edge]], but with golden ridges instead of red ridges.

== Trivia ==
*During the event, players could collect as many [[Candies (2020)|Candies]] (acts exactly like [[coins]] but halloween-exclusive) and score points which will determine their rank on the leaderboard.
*When this item first came out on December 13th, 2020, it displayed as a [[Godly Weapons|godly]], and was fixed roughly an hour later.
*Other variants of this include [[Bronze Vampire's Edge]], [[Silver Vampire's Edge]], and [[Blue Vampire's Edge]].
*This item is a gold reskin of [[Vampire's Edge]], a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife.
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*The sole owner of this knife is '''[[ironjenjin]]'''.
*The revamped version of this item was uploaded on January 23rd, 2023.

